stevedore orchestrates external tools — docker buildx, git, cosign, syft,
grype, trivy, crane, aws and gh — by running them as separate programs. It
contains no code from any of them, and none is bundled in its binary or its
container image; each is installed separately under its own license.

Releases up to and including v1.0.1 were published under the MIT License, and
remain available under those terms.
